<title>POLAND: REMAK OCT NET FALLS TO PLN 0.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>REMAK OCT NET FALLS TO PLN 0.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.17 vs   0.37</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.01 vs   0.60</p>
<p> Operating loss	 0.03 vs   0.46 profit</p>
<p> Sales		    6.09 vs  10.65</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.75 vs   2.17</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.75 vs   4.53</p>
<p> Operating loss	 0.37 vs   4.82 profit</p>
<p> Sales		   61.23 vs  89.72</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish construction company is Remak</p>
<p>SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
